export RBMODE=0
export CORE_PLL=50M
export INT_PLL=50M

Core PLL is the clock for the FPGA streamer circuit (decoder). Internal PLL generates the clock for clocking out the date from the output FIFO buffer, i.e., it's a "data clock.

CORE_PLL=100M and INT_PLL=10M pass all tests.


pptest 2 -int_clk -int_pll 25M -veryverbose -check
pptest 2 -ext_clk -veryverbose -check
pptest 2 -clk 2 -veryverbose -check
